  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing the Impact of Large Scale-Agricultural Investment in The Mekong</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing the impact of large scale agricultural investments in the Mekong region on communities, forest and climate change. Advocacy and capacity building focusing on rubber production in key Mekong countries.</narrative>
  </description>
